out.push(A('**282 words, every operative sentence naming its object, no substitution reaching outside its own sentence, the problem sentence quoted rather than described, a rule with its boundary named, and the cost recorded without an adverb in it.** ⚠ **The sentence that earns the band is _both readings were available from the sentence, and the sentence was written in this office._** **It takes the fault before anybody can allocate it**, which is what makes the rest of the minute readable by the two branches that got it wrong.'));
out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — band 1)'));
