out.push(A('One student reads an operative sentence with the noun repeated and then with _the latter_ in its place. ⚠ **The room says which it would act on without checking.** **The repeated noun, every time.** **Then the cost: two or three words.** **This is the cheapest trade in the unit and the one that most offends a writer\'s ear**, which is worth saying, because the objection the class will make is about elegance and the answer is about four months.'));
