out.push(A('One student reads a premodified phrase at speed and the room says what the thing is; then the unpacked version. ⚠ **The room gets the second and usually not the first, and the second is longer.** **Make a student say that sentence rather than saying it yourself** — **it is the only place in Unit 6 where more words is the answer, and it will be believed if it comes from the room.** **Then Mr Tayara\'s sentence to end on.**'));
