out.push(A('Two students exchange summaries and each writes the minute the other\'s would produce. ⚠ **Where a minute is stronger than the summary it came from, the summary has a verb in it that should have been a number.** **Count how many of the room\'s minutes are stronger** — **in a first run it is most of them, and the count falls sharply the second time.** **Then Dr Qabbani\'s sentence to end on.**'));
