out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('One student reads their top line and a partner checks four facts, timed. ⚠ **About forty seconds for four.** **Ask what that buys** — **a reader who does it once stops asking for summaries**, which is what happened to the chairman in 6.7 and is the connection to make now rather than in the next cycle. **Then Mrs Oueidat\'s sentence to end on: the number was not for them.**'));
