out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('Each pair\'s question to the author and sentence to the reader. ⚠ **Pair B is the one where the author has already diagnosed it** — _most of it is the same as last quarter_ — **and a fact count there would waste an afternoon.** **The question is which pages changed, and the answer turns fourteen pages into two.** **A writer who has named the problem has asked a question**, and the three moves exist for writers who have not. **Ask the room how they would tell the two cases apart**, and the test is whether the covering note contains a fact.'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
